+For singular tags, `L=E_l`, the total-transform classes and proximity rules in
+Section 3 are binding, and the physical attachment partition is part of the
+state.  The Euler theorem eliminates `B_9/A_8`, leaving eight singular tags
+plus the smooth row.  The `B_8/A_7` row is extremal with
