+This confirms `P:337-362` and `CI:127-143`.
+
+The producer sentence at `P:364-366` is literally wrong for `q=6`.  Replace
+"the three prescribed smooth attachment points" by:
+
+```text
+the three unit branch attachments, partitioned into two physical smooth
+points for q=6 and three physical smooth points for q=8.
+```
