+## 11. Maximum safe theorem
+
+In the charged normal irreducible class-`2A+3B`, reduced-infinity,
+finite-near-`H`, dominant-first-leg scope, the infinity curve is F5 and all
+eight `H.R_X` units occur at its unique triple/tangency point.  After choosing
+one section branch `S`, the minimal resolution has an `S`-adapted nine-blowup
+marking over `F_2`:
